<title>USA: Physicians Sales to distribute Agfa film.</title>
<headline>Physicians Sales to distribute Agfa film.</headline>
<dateline>RIDGEFIELD PARK, N.J. 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Physician Sales &amp; Services Inc's Diagnostic Imaging Inc unit said Monday that it has entered into an agreement to distribute Agfa medical film, film processors, and imaging products as well as Agfa's Drystar 2000 dry digital imager.</p>
<p>Diagnostic Imaging Inc has over 60 sales representatives and nearly 200 service engineers based throughout its current coverage area.</p>
<p>Agfa is part of the Agfa-Gevaert Group, a unit of the German chemical company Bayer AG.</p>
